{"id": "section-body-29104", "title": "Rheumatoid Arthritis (RA)", "chapterId": "chapter-twenty-six", "tocLevel": 4, "tocPath": ["APPROACH TO PATIENTS WITH EMERGENCY CONDITIONS", "RHEUMATOLOGICAL DISORDERS", "Inflammatory Arthritis", "Rheumatoid Arthritis (RA)"], "blocks": [{"id": "body-29104", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Rheumatoid Arthritis (RA)", "runs": [{"text": "Rheumatoid"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Arthritis"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(RA)"}], "level": 4, "list": {"level": 2, "numberingId": "105"}}, {"id": "body-29105", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "\nReactive Arthritis", "runs": [{"text": "\n"}, {"text": "Reactive"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Arthritis"}], "list": {"level": 3, "numberingId": "105"}}, {"id": "body-29106", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Enteropathic Arthritis (associated with IBD)", "runs": [{"text": "Enteropathic"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Arthritis"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(associated"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "IBD)"}], "list": {"level": 3, "numberingId": "105"}}, {"id": "body-29108", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "RA is a chronic, systemic autoimmune disease that primarily affects synovial joints, causing symmetrical inflammation, pain, and progressive joint deformity. It often involves the hands and feet, but any synovial joint may be affected. Extra-articular manifestations (such as those affecting the skin, heart, lungs, and eyes) can also occur.", "runs": [{"text": "RA is a chronic, systemic autoimmune disease that primarily affects synovial joints, causing symmetrical inflammation, pain, and progressive joint deformity. It often involves the hands and feet, but any synovial joint may be affected. Extra-articular manifestations (such as those affecting the skin, heart, lungs, and eyes) can also occur."}]}, {"id": "body-29110", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Clinical Presentation", "runs": [{"text": "Clinical"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Presentation"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-29111", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Symmetrical joint swelling, stiffness, and pain", "runs": [{"text": "Symmetrical"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "joint"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "swelling,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "stiffness,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "pain"}], "list": {"level": 4, "numberingId": "105"}}, {"id": "body-29112", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Morning stiffness >30 minutes", "runs": [{"text": "Morning"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "stiffness"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": ">30"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "minutes"}], "list": {"level": 4, "numberingId": "105"}}, {"id": "body-29113", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Fatigue and general malaise", "runs": [{"text": "Fatigue"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "general"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "malaise"}], "list": {"level": 4, "numberingId": "105"}}, {"id": "body-29114", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Extra-articular signs (e.g., nodules, lung or eye involvement)", "runs": [{"text": "Extra-articular"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "signs"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(e.g.,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "nodules,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "lung"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "eye"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "involvement)"}], "list": {"level": 4, "numberingId": "105"}}, {"id": "body-29115", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Small and large joint tenderness, swelling, stiffness, pain on motion, deformity, and functional limitation.", "runs": [{"text": "Small"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "large"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "joint"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "tenderness,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "swelling,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "stiffness,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "pain"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "on"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "motion,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "deformity,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "functional"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "limitation."}], "list": {"level": 4, "numberingId": "105"}}, {"id": "body-29116", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Investigations", "runs": [{"text": "Investigations"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-29117", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "CBC: anemia of chronic disease, thrombocytosis, or leukopenia (may occur with Felty's syndrome or DMARD toxicity).", "runs": [{"text": "CBC:"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "anemia"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "chronic"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "disease,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "thrombocytosis,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "leukopenia"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(may"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "occur"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Felty's"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "syndrome"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "DMARD"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "toxicity)."}], "list": {"level": 4, "numberingId": "105"}}, {"id": "body-29118", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "ESR and CRP: used both for diagnosis and monitoring disease activity and treatment response. Serologic tests: RF: Positive in ~70–80% of RA cases; less specific. Anti-CCP: More specific for RA; indicates a risk of severe erosive disease and extra-articular disease.", "runs": [{"text": "ESR and CRP: used both for diagnosis and monitoring disease activity and treatment response. Serologic tests: RF: Positive in ~70–80% of RA cases; less specific. Anti-CCP: More specific for RA; indicates a risk of severe erosive disease and extra-articular disease."}], "list": {"level": 4, "numberingId": "105"}}, {"id": "body-29119", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Imaging", "runs": [{"text": "Imaging"}], "list": {"level": 4, "numberingI